abstract: >
  Reference implementation of Role-Conditioned Evidentiary Adequacy (RCEA),
  a computable framework for assessing whether AI audit evidence is adequate
  for role-conditioned governance decisions. The engine generates role-specific
  evidence passports with deterministic scoring, full traceability, suppression
  logging, and limitation propagation from a common synthetic evidence substrate.
